===Ask Dan Heng about his thoughts{{subst:void|<!--201020102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Passenger Cabin|update|(Trailblazer)'s Trailblaze Daily Report:<br />March wants to go. Asking Dan Heng next.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''March 7th:''' Dan Heng! Bronya just sent all of us a message. Did you see it yet?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Yes, I saw it.
:'''March 7th:''' Then why didn't you reply? Bronya's a good friend of ours!
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...I'm sorry, I'm just not in the mood for idle chat. There's been a lot weighing on my mind since the Luofu... it was tough on the spirit.
:'''March 7th:''' Dan Heng...
:'''March 7th:''' I'm the one who should be sorry &mdash; I was being too pushy! You're right, you went through a lot on the Xianzhou &mdash; take all the time you need...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Dan Heng, stay on the Express and get some rest.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Thank you for understanding, (Trailblazer).
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why not come with us for a change of scenery?
::'''Dan Heng:''' No, thanks &mdash; I'll be staying on the Express.
:'''Dan Heng:''' It's great that Belobog is able to host a celebration. I hope your trip goes well &mdash; say hi to our friends for me.
:'''March 7th:''' Okay! Rest up &mdash; you're not allowed to miss the next Trailblaze expedition!
:'''Dan Heng:''' Mm, I'll be there next time.
----
----
:'''March 7th:''' He won't budge, huh? Looks like it's just the two of us then.
:'''March 7th:''' Pity, he's gonna miss out! We never get the chance to go on a stress-free adventure.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He's been through a lot lately.
::'''March 7th:''' I know... But it's still a shame, don't you think?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Stress-free for us, or stress-free for the planet?
::'''March 7th:''' Don't get yourself all worked up. If Jarilo-VI is strong enough to withstand a Stellaron, it'll be just fine.
:'''March 7th:''' If only Himeko could come with us...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Should we ask Mr. Yang to come with us?
::'''March 7th:''' Mm, maybe not. He's still wheezing from the trouble we got into on the Xianzhou. You didn't notice?
::'''March 7th:''' At his age, he might not appreciate the extra... excitement.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What about Pom-Pom?
::'''March 7th:''' Pom-Pom can't just leave the Express whenever they feel like it. You didn't know?
::'''March 7th:''' Seems like someone wasn't paying attention!
:'''March 7th:''' (Trailblazer), why don't we go ask Himeko to tag along? She might be up for an adventure!
:'''March 7th:''' You've been on the Express for a while now, but you've never gone on a trip with Himeko before, right? Well, now's your chance!
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Ask Himeko about her intentions{{subst:void|<!--201020103-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Passenger Cabin|update|(Trailblazer)'s Trailblaze Daily Report:<br />Dan Heng's not going, too stubborn. Asking Himeko, but probably unlikely.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Himeko:''' Hey, March. That's a big smile on your face &mdash; what's the good news?
:'''March 7th:''' Himeko! There's a celebration coming up on Jarilo-VI, organized by the Supreme Guardian, and we're invited to go take in the sights and sounds.
:'''March 7th:''' Dan Heng won't be going anywhere for a while &mdash; he's still resting up, so... wanna come with us?
:'''March 7th:''' I mean, considering how you helped us out with Cocolia, I'm sure Bronya would be happy to see you!
:'''Himeko:''' Ahh, so that explains the grin &mdash; you're excited about the celebration.
:'''Himeko:''' Thanks for the invite, but I'm afraid my hands are full right now. Please send my regards to the Supreme Guardian.
:'''Himeko:''' Make the most of the festivities &mdash; you've earned it! You two and Dan Heng did help save Jarilo-VI, after all. I'll be sure to join you guys next time.
:'''March 7th:''' Navigators really do have their plates full, huh? Seems like it's just you and me this time.
:'''March 7th:''' Let me go pack some stuff for the trip first. (Trailblazer), come and find me when you're ready to set off.
----

;(Talk to Himeko)
:'''Himeko:''' I've got a lot going on right now, but I'll try to make it next time.
:'''Himeko:''' I'm sure you'll have a great time. Don't forget to send my regards to the Supreme Guardian while you're there.
{{Dialogue End}}

